// Title: Notepad Password Files Discovery
// ID: 3b4e950b-a3ea-44d3-877e-432071990709
// Status: experimental
// Level: low
// Author: The DFIR Report
// Date: 2025-02-21
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1083
// Description: Detects the execution of Notepad to open a file that has the string "password" which may indicate unauthorized access to credentials or suspicious activity.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(where(ParentImage IENDSWITH "\\explorer.exe") AND where(Image IENDSWITH "\\notepad.exe") AND (where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "password*.txt") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "password*.csv") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "password*.doc") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "password*.xls")))
